@HostAddress = https://localhost:7150

### 1) Kategorije iz seed podataka -> 200, tri stavke
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories

###
### 2) Kreiranje proizvoda -> 201, Location: /api/products/1
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tastatura",
  "sku": "KB-100",
  "description": "Mehanicka, US raspored",
  "price": 4990,
  "stockQuantity": 12,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###
### 3) Isti SKU -> 409, type: https://minishop.rs/errors/duplicate-sku
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Druga tastatura",
  "sku": "KB-100",
  "price": 5990,
  "stockQuantity": 3,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###
### 4) Lista -> 200, category: "Periferija" (JOIN iz projekcije)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?categoryId=1&sort=price

###
### 5) Izmena -> 204; zatim GET /api/products/1 vraca price 4490
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tastatura",
  "price": 4490,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

###
### 6) Nepostojeci -> 404, type: https://minishop.rs/errors/product-not-found
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/999